  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:10.532" end="00:12.665" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(dwilly, I'm scared)</p>
      <p begin="00:12.665" end="00:14.165" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: 1nonly]</p>
      <p begin="00:13.214" end="00:14.714" ttm:agent="v1">She a Ghostkilla</p>
      <p begin="00:14.532" end="00:17.233" ttm:agent="v1">Drown his body in the river, go, black figure</p>
      <p begin="00:17.233" end="00:19.646" ttm:agent="v1">Black mask with the ruler, don't pull the trigger</p>
      <p begin="00:19.646" end="00:21.146" ttm:agent="v1">Money bigger</p>
      <p begin="00:20.971" end="00:25.495" ttm:agent="v1">Only time I'm down is when I drop a bag, a bag to pick up</p>
      <p begin="00:25.495" end="00:28.797" ttm:agent="v1">And now he wanna walk out, lights, Glock, action</p>
      <p begin="00:28.797" end="00:31.492" ttm:agent="v1">Said she wanna stay and so she gave me satisfaction</p>
      <p begin="00:31.492" end="00:33.107" ttm:agent="v1">That p***y talk down</p>
      <p begin="00:33.107" end="00:34.698" ttm:agent="v1">Throwing b****ts where yo' cap is</p>
      <p begin="00:34.698" end="00:37.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ruger got a flash (Ayy, ayy), I caught you lackin' (Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:37.970" end="00:39.470" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1: 1nonly]</p>
      <p begin="00:38.507" end="00:40.618" ttm:agent="v1">Say he wanna **** with us, please don't **** with us</p>
      <p begin="00:40.618" end="00:43.827" ttm:agent="v1">A b—, a black mask just in case we **** it up</p>
      <p begin="00:43.827" end="00:47.050" ttm:agent="v1">She suck-she suck-she suck it up, we shut 'em up</p>
      <p begin="00:47.050" end="00:48.674" ttm:agent="v1">I'm at your crib, knock down your door</p>
      <p begin="00:48.674" end="00:51.122" ttm:agent="v1">Lil' b***h, I think your luck is up</p>
      <p begin="00:51.122" end="00:52.622" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: 1nonly]</p>
      <p begin="00:51.368" end="00:52.868" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause she a Ghostkilla</p>
      <p begin="00:52.433" end="00:55.421" ttm:agent="v1">Drown his body in the river, go, black figure</p>
      <p begin="00:55.421" end="00:58.369" ttm:agent="v1">Black mask with the ruler, don't pull the trigger</p>
      <p begin="00:58.369" end="00:59.869" ttm:agent="v1">Money bigger</p>
      <p begin="00:59.462" end="01:02.927" ttm:agent="v1">Only time I'm down is when I drop a bag, a bag to pick up</p>
      <p begin="01:02.927" end="01:06.184" ttm:agent="v1">And now he wanna walk out, lights, Glock, action</p>
      <p begin="01:06.184" end="01:09.131" ttm:agent="v1">Said she wanna stay and so she gave me satisfaction</p>
      <p begin="01:09.131" end="01:11.012" ttm:agent="v1">That p***y talk down</p>
      <p begin="01:11.012" end="01:12.512" ttm:agent="v1">Throwing b****ts where yo' cap is</p>
      <p begin="01:12.115" end="01:15.331" ttm:agent="v1">Ruger got a flash bang, bang, I caught you lackin'</p>
      <p begin="01:15.331" end="01:18.291" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ayy, b***h I'm in a black mask (Black mask), bring it back</p>
      <p begin="01:18.291" end="01:21.247" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I just got a brand new Glock (What?) blatt, blatt (Ah)</p>
      <p begin="01:21.247" end="01:24.226" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Shoot 'em in his face (Bam), now he just a hashtag (Ha)</p>
      <p begin="01:24.226" end="01:27.721" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">B-Bloody business, bury b*****s while I'm in his Wraith (Yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:27.721" end="01:31.482" ttm:agent="v1">All up in here, flexed up, next up, ghostfaced killer</p>
      <p begin="01:31.482" end="01:34.698" ttm:agent="v1">With my blade tucked, b***h get on my d**k</p>
      <p begin="01:34.698" end="01:36.198" ttm:agent="v1">And ride that shit like a parade, yuh</p>
      <p begin="01:36.068" end="01:37.568" ttm:agent="v1">Set it off, break it off</p>
      <p begin="01:37.403" end="01:38.903" ttm:agent="v1">Lil' b***h, no you won't make it</p>
      <p begin="01:38.748" end="01:40.653" ttm:agent="v1">Why the **** you think she let you crawl?</p>
      <p begin="01:40.653" end="01:42.153" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: 1nonly, Jasiah]</p>
      <p begin="01:41.198" end="01:42.698" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause she a Ghostkilla</p>
      <p begin="01:42.254" end="01:45.238" ttm:agent="v1">Drown his body in the river, go, black figure</p>
      <p begin="01:45.238" end="01:48.201" ttm:agent="v1">Black mask with the ruler, don't pull the trigger</p>
      <p begin="01:48.201" end="01:49.701" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Money bigger (Uh, uh)</p>
      <p begin="01:49.557" end="01:53.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Only time I'm down is when I drop a bag, a bag to pick up (A bag to pick up, huh)</p>
      <p begin="01:53.330" end="01:56.035" ttm:agent="v1">And now he wanna walk out, lights, Glock, action</p>
      <p begin="01:56.035" end="01:59.259" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Said she wanna stay and so she gave me satisfaction (Ayy, satisfaction)</p>
      <p begin="01:59.259" end="02:00.759" ttm:agent="v1">That p***y talk down</p>
      <p begin="02:00.600" end="02:02.484" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Throwing b****ts where yo' cap is (Where yo' cap, b***h)</p>
      <p begin="02:02.484" end="02:06.219" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Ruger got a flash, bang, bang, I caught you lackin' (Uh, uh)</p>
      <p begin="02:06.219" end="02:07.719" ttm:agent="v1">[Outro: Jasiah]</p>
      <p begin="02:07.299" end="02:11.299" ttm:agent="v1">Ghostkilla</p>
